  "description": "Determination as to whether prior approval is required for change of use from Commercial, Business and Service (Use Class E) to Dwellinghouses (Use Class C3).",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - By reason of the insufficiently detailed and inaccurate floor plans and the lack of elevation drawings submitted, insufficient information has been provided to enable the authority to establish whether the proposed development complies with the conditions attached to Class MA of Part 3, Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended). The application is therefore contrary to Condition MA.2 (4), part (2) (BC) and part (3) (b) of paragraph W of this order, as well as Paragraph 9A of Article 3, and prior approval is refused. "
